    "",
    "Change its value with the action \"Value\" (for example to the speed of a car): the needle turns, the digital value and the segmented bar change, smoothly. The maximum value should match the numbers drawn on its dial, and the unit (\"km/h\", \"mph\"...) is a property.",
    "",
    "Ready-to-use speedometers are in the asset store [speedometers pack](https://editor.gdevelop.io/?initial-dialog=asset-store&asset-pack=speedometers-speedometers)."
